CARRIED PATCH - fork content, not upstream. Provenance and why, for whoever
reads this.

Source: RyanDam/zephyr commit f50faa7bcb38, "cmake: modules: Add new
post_boards_shields extension", by Pete Johanson, part of the
v4.4.1+zmk-fixes fork branch. Not in upstream Zephyr 4.4 or 4.5.

Why we need it: ZMK's own app/boards/post_boards_shields.cmake is what turns
the config repo's <shield>.keymap into a devicetree overlay, and prepends
app/app.overlay. Without the hook that file is never included, so the keymap
and app/dts/behaviors.dtsi never reach the devicetree: no keymap node, no
behavior nodes, and behavior_dynamic_macro.c fails with
  "DT_N_INST_0_zmk_behavior_dynamic_macro_FULL_NAME too long"
because DT_INST() expands to a token that was never generated.

What it does: adds cmake/modules/post_boards_shields.cmake, which includes
<BOARD_ROOT>/boards/post_boards_shields.cmake for every board root once boards
and shields are resolved, and appends it to zephyr_cmake_modules after
"shields" in zephyr_default.cmake.

Deviation from the fork commit: the hunk in zephyr_default.cmake is
re-anchored, because 4.5's module list around it changed (no zephyr_module /
arch_v1 entries). The new file is byte-for-byte the fork's.

Applied to: zephyr/ (paths below are relative to the zephyr tree root).
Delete when: the hook is upstreamed (ZMK carries it in its fork today) or ZMK
gains another way to inject the keymap overlay.

Verified against: Zephyr v4.5.0 (2026-11-19).
diff --git a/cmake/modules/post_boards_shields.cmake b/cmake/modules/post_boards_shields.cmake
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..83f9b29859
--- /dev/null
+++ b/cmake/modules/post_boards_shields.cmake
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+#
+# Copyright (c) 2025, Pete Johanson
+
+# Perform any post-processing/customization once details of selected board and shields
+# is fully loaded.
+#
+# This CMake module will TODO.
+#
+include_guard(GLOBAL)
+
+include(python)
+include(extensions)
+
+foreach(root ${BOARD_ROOT})
+  message("Checking ${root}")
+  if (EXISTS ${root}/boards/post_boards_shields.cmake)
+    message("found ${root}")
+    include(${root}/boards/post_boards_shields.cmake)
+  endif()
+endforeach()
